  "caption": "Mandarin anime-opening J-rock in the style of 2010s shonen theme songs. Twin distorted electric guitars with fast tremolo-picked lead lines, driving eighth-note picked bass, fast drums with crash accents and double-time chorus, bright piano doubling the hook. Bright compressed band production. Male high tenor vocal, powerful and clearly sung. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 172 BPM, D major. Mock-heroic, determined mood. No autotune, no rap, no EDM synths, no metal growls, no ballad tempo.",
  "lyrics": "[Intro - tremolo guitar lead, crash cymbals]\n\n[Verse 1]\n下班回家關上門\n桌上一顆紅蘋果\n削皮刀在燈下閃\n今晚要破兩米三\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n手腕慢慢地轉\n呼吸不要亂\n\n[Chorus]\n一刀不斷 一刀不斷\n果皮垂到我的腳邊\n別說話 別打噴嚏\n這一圈是我的戰場\n\n[Verse 2]\n她吃到第一百顆\n說她牙齒會發酸\n我說再陪我一晚\n明天換成水梨好嗎\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n兩米二 兩米三\n我閉上眼睛\n\n[Chorus]\n一刀不斷 一刀不斷\n果皮繞過整個客廳\n她鼓掌 我才敢喘\n這一刀是為你削的\n\n[Outro - guitars, last chord ring]\n蘋果給你 皮留給我",
